cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "rdocfmriqc: Behavioral Quality Control for the RDoC fMRI Task Battery"
abstract: >-
  Computes per-session behavioral metrics for the RDoC fMRI task battery and
  flags sessions whose performance falls outside defined thresholds. Every
  threshold lives in one module and every flag rule is covered by a test, so a
  QC check cannot be silently switched off by a renamed metric. The package
  carries no participant data: its test suite and demo run end to end on
  synthetic trials built in memory.
type: software
